expected_result: "Post-merge guidance directs agents to pm merge reconcile, distinguishes drift repair from receipt settlement, and leaves lossless audit evidence non-blocking while refusing lossy application without deliberate confirmation."
actual_result: "Merge reconciliation, installation guidance, and diagnostics now point at pm merge reconcile --dry-run; reconciliation audits all receipts, rejects lossless receipt application without force, and preserves legacy receipt compatibility."
